{"title":"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_13\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 13</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(variant_of_Solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (variant of Solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_very_fast\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 very fast</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Testing_Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Testing Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(🚀17_minutes_only🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (🚀17 minutes only🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_13\">Problem 13</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 13\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Jamal has a drawer containing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> green socks, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> purple socks, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> orange socks. After adding more purple socks, Jamal noticed that there is now a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd7edd3842c40dbc1e54e522917a6e07b43c92e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> chance that a sock randomly selected from the drawer is purple. How many purple socks did Jamal add?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/9/eb95cf177940d5c2a355be4f25b14985d485d2bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }6 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }9 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }12 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }18 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"380\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After Jamal adds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> purple socks, he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b1204fb66d985aac71a8cfa9f6514098f6dbd4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(18+x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> purple socks and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/0/230b94ad26e66d39646c071b5f02bf30d6ed6883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6+18+12+x=(36+x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"210\" height=\"18\" /> total socks. This means the probability of drawing a purple sock is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/9/a8922138739d12864a01c34cb4eaa22abe37c3c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18+x}{36+x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"57\" height=\"40\" />, so we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27eeecf70d84202b3cd94eeb82151ab6f223b96.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{18+x}{36+x}=\\frac{3}{5}\\]\" width=\"88\" height=\"39\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5dbf39f61ef12e8058008888db76e0ab7911c9ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18+9}{36+9}=\\frac{27}{45}=\\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"135\" height=\"39\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3b09e18d34b772e1ca5645f83afb72619997262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28variant_of_Solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(variant_of_Solution_1)\">Solution 2 (variant of Solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (variant of Solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As in Solution 1, we have the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e5b339834bfb295a08a6b388d18ee8bc40c8ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18+x}{36+x}=\\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"90\" height=\"39\" />. Cross-multiplying yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e911e39138ca602e91f4d6781697d759327918.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90+5x=108+3x \\Rightarrow 2x=18 \\Rightarrow x=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"314\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, Jamal added <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3b09e18d34b772e1ca5645f83afb72619997262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> purple socks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_very_fast\">Solution 3 very fast</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 very fast\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Testing_Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Testing_Answer_Choices)\">Solution 4 (Testing Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Testing Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The probability that a randomly selected sock is purple is: The # of purple socks ÷ The total # of socks. We can test the answer choices until we find the correct answer.\n</p><p><br />\n[A] If Jamal adds 6 purple socks, he will have 18 + 6 = 24 purple socks. The probability of a randomly selected sock being purple after adding 6 socks is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/8/f48862cfe7076b0807140872dda7cdee4d8e1f1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{6+24+12}=\\frac{24}{42}=\\frac{4}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"179\" height=\"40\" />, which isn't equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac40ce1434cda0943c408cc185f5976212d95801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p><br />\n[B] If Jamal adds 9 purple socks, he will have 18 + 9 = 27 purple socks. The probability of a randomly selected sock being purple after adding 9 socks is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/8/9380f91e93a023e9ecee239b39e1e564de4b0061.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{27}{6+27+12}=\\frac{27}{45}=\\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"179\" height=\"40\" />, which is indeed equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac40ce1434cda0943c408cc185f5976212d95801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nSo our final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3b09e18d34b772e1ca5645f83afb72619997262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> purple socks.\n</p><p>~ TealBear16 🐰\n</p><p>~ FunnyLizard15 🐶 (Assistance)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_.28Easy_to_understand.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bHNrBwwUCMI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bHNrBwwUCMI</a>\n</p><p>~NiuniuMaths\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=6Ux3fNTMn5tSUnP3&amp;t=1833\">https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=6Ux3fNTMn5tSUnP3&amp;t=1833</a> \n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.F0.9F.9A.8017_minutes_only.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(🚀17_minutes_only🚀)\">Video Solution (🚀17 minutes only🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (🚀17 minutes only🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0nnyYRYi-40\">https://youtu.be/0nnyYRYi-40</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u81EWYcC0Wg\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u81EWYcC0Wg</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/x9Di0yxUqeU\">https://youtu.be/x9Di0yxUqeU</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xjwDsaRE_Wo\">https://youtu.be/xjwDsaRE_Wo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=546\">https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=546</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mGQw1yALXYM&amp;t=1545s\">https://youtu.be/mGQw1yALXYM&amp;t=1545s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a hre